<section class="cs__sec" aria-labelledby="s8">
  <p class="st-k rv">08 · Reflection</p>
  <h2 class="cs__h rv" id="s8">More than visual presentation</h2>
  <p class="cs__p rv">
    People visit healthcare websites with practical questions. How information is structured, how
    professional details are communicated, and how easily visitors can reach someone shape the
    experience as much as the visuals do.
  </p>
  <div class="st-grid st-g2 st-wide">
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Learning</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">Design the whole journey</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">
        I approached the site as one journey, from understanding the organization to exploring its
        offerings and getting in touch.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Growth</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">From requirements to a launched product</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">
        Turning research and requirements into a structured interface, and carrying it through to a
        live site.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

